    "detailed_description": "Platform:<br />\r\nSteam<br />\r\nGame play<br />\r\n is a first person adventure puzzle game. The protagonist controled by players is a patient with dark phobia. If he is in a narrow environment or the light source disappears, the protagonist will be swallowed up by boundless fear. In the game, players must expand the exploration area by lighting the light source, avoid the darkness, solve layers of mysteries, complete the task, and finally escape the danger.<br />\r\nStyle<br />\r\nTiny terror\uff0cdark environment<br />\r\nStory:<br />\r\nThis is a story about the constant challenges of special people (special occupation + symptoms) and finally overcome their fears and break through themselves. Part of the story is adapted from real events.",
